---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: Posts from Jay Bell - everything published here plus my writing around the web.
eleventyNavigation:
    key: Blog
    order: 4
---

<section class="py-14 pb-[72px]">
    <div class="animate-rise">
        <h1 class="mb-3 font-display text-[clamp(30px,5vw,42px)] tracking-tight text-ink">Blog</h1>
        <p class="mb-10 max-w-[560px] text-base leading-[1.65] text-ink2">
            A single stream of my writing - everything published on this site plus my posts around the web.
        </p>
    </div>

    {% set stream = collections.posts | mergeStream(advocu_activities | gdePosts) %}
    {% if stream.length %}
        <div class="flex flex-col border-t border-line">
            {% for item in stream %}
                <article class="group grid grid-cols-[120px_1fr] items-baseline gap-6 border-b border-line py-[22px] max-sm:grid-cols-1 max-sm:gap-1.5 transition-[background,border-color] duration-150 hover:bg-surface2 hover:border-ink3 max-sm:px-3 max-sm:-mx-3" data-reveal>
                    <time class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink3" datetime="{{ item.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ item.date | readableDate }}</time>
                    <div>
                        <a class="block text-inherit no-underline" href="{{ item.url }}" {% if item.isExternal %}target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>
                            <div class="font-display text-xl text-ink group-hover:text-accent">{{ item.title }}</div>
                            {% if item.description %}
                                <p class="mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-ink2">{{ item.description }}</p>
                            {% endif %}
                            <div class="mt-2.5 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                                <span class="pill">{{ item.site }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    {% else %}
        <p>No posts yet. Writing on Angular, Nx, and open source lands here - grab the <a href="/feed.xml">RSS feed</a> to catch it.</p>
    {% endif %}
</section>
